  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Public Financial Management Reform Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase predictability, efficiency and control in budget management, develop capacity of public finance officials, and enhance internal and external oversight.Support to the Government of Sierra Leone to improve its public financial management systems and processes.  This includes increasing the predictability, efficiency and control in budget management, developing the capacity of public finance officials, and enhancing internal and external oversight.</narrative>
